What does this program print?

```dart
String f(Object o) => switch (o) {
  [int a, int b] when a > b => 'desc',
  [int _, int _] => 'pair',
  [_, ...] => 'list',
  int n when n.isEven => 'even',
  _ => 'other',
};

void main() {
  print([[3, 1], [1, 3], [1], 4, 5].map(f).join(' '));
}
```

